218
05:35:54,646 --> 05:35:56,227
Auto's worden vernield.

219
05:35:56,746 --> 05:36:01,246
Mensen zitten gevangen in hun eigen
huizen, want ze durven 's avonds...

220
05:36:01,307 --> 05:36:04,687
